          "quote": "ship change under Section 382 occurs if one or more stockholders (or group of stockholders) who are each deemed to own at least 5% of the Company s stock (such holders, 5-percent stockholders ) change their ownership by more than 50 percentage points over their lowest percentage within a rolling three-year period. The Tax Plan contributes to the preservation of the Company s Tax Attributes by reducing the risk that an ownership change under Section 382 occurs. The Board of Directors adopted the Tax Plan to reduce the risk of an ownership change under Section 382. The Tax Plan deters any person or group from becoming, or obtaining the right to become, a 5-percent stockholder for purposes of Section 382 or, in certain cases, from increasing such person s or group s ownership of shares of the Company s common stock beyond 4.99%, in each case, without first obtaining the approval of the Boar",
